<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάστρα</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστερό-τρη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the lower
			part</i> of a vessel <i>bulging out like a paunch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίποδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.348
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>; <i>hull</i> of a ship, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a <i>vase
				with such a belly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				4.2
			</span></i> (prob. l.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.420.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).174.26
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.14.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				14.8.2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>architectural member</i> of similar shape, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Milet.</u>
				7.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				29.460
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστήρ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>back of the thigh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γογγυλὶς ἢ κράμβη</span>
			, Id.</div>
